cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "MINERVA Space Echo"
abstract: >-
  An experimental audio effect (AU/VST3) that treats Hintzman's MINERVA II
  multiple-trace memory model as a tape echo: every segment of incoming audio
  is stored as a memory trace, and the echo is an activation-weighted blend of
  the traces most similar to what is playing now.
type: software
authors:
